{'symbol': 'RCL', 'date': '2022-01-27 12:10:00', 'title': "IT'S OFFICIAL: WORLD'S NEWEST WONDER JOINS ROYAL CARIBBEAN INTERNATIONAL", 'text': "MIAMI, JAN. 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ADVENTURES ABOARD THE WORLD'S NEWEST WONDER ARE ON THE HORIZON FOR VACATIONERS OF ALL AGES. TODAY, ROYAL CARIBBEAN INTERNATIONAL TOOK DELIVERY OF WONDER OF THE SEAS , THE NEXT HIGHLY ANTICIPATED AND INNOVATIVE SHIP IN THE CRUISE LINE'S AWARD-WINNING LINEUP."}